Update buildbot-worker-4.3.0's setup.py/setup.cfg for modern setuptools:
 - replace the deprecated free-text license classifier with the
   'license_expression' SPDX key ("License classifiers are deprecated")
 - remove the obsolete 'tests_require' key
   ("Unknown distribution option: 'tests_require'")
 - remove the deprecated [bdist_wheel] universal=1 setting
   ("bdist_wheel.universal is deprecated"); Buildbot Worker 4.3.0 is
   Python 3-only, so a universal (py2.py3) wheel tag is wrong regardless

Upstream status: not submitted.

